{% comment %}
    VOLUNTEER OPPORTUNITY DETAIL — one opportunity, as a card
    (Styles/_volunteer.scss): /next-steps/volunteer/detail?OpportunityId=<id>.
    Shown in the volunteer page's pop-up (VolunteerListing.lava; theme.js
    "Frame pop-up") and on its own when linked directly.

    Page:                     Layout Blank (Layouts/Blank.aspx), so it fits
                              the pop-up
    Block 1 (Main zone):      an HTML block
      Block content:          {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/VolunteerOpportunityDetail.lava' %}
      Enabled Lava Commands:  RockEntity
    Block 2 (Main zone):      Rock's Connection Opportunity Signup block,
                              below it. It reads the same OpportunityId.
      theme.js ("Group details", which also runs this card) moves it into
      the card's back (found by Rock's own class,
      connection-opportunity-signup; to use a different block, give it the
      CSS Class volunteer-signup). It takes the Life Group card's form
      styles (Styles/_group-detail.scss).
      Its Lava Template: blank (this card already shows the opportunity).
      Without JavaScript, or without the block, there's no flip: the block
      (if any) shows under the card.

    THE CARD (flips, as the Life Group card)
      Front   an ultrawide header: the photo (PLACEHOLDER: the green
              gradient until the opportunity has one) with the team and the
              name over it, and at its lower right "Email <name>" (the
              opportunity's default connector: the first campus that has one
              with an active email; no connector, no link). Then the summary,
              the description, "Sign up to serve" (flips the card) and, on its
              own page (not in the pop-up, which has its close), All
              opportunities.
      Back    a slim band (Back, Sign up, the name), then the sign-up block.
              After the form posts back the card opens on its back again (the
              browser session remembers), so the result shows where the form
              was.
    An opportunity that's missing, inactive or in another connection type
    gets a note instead.
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%} ===== SETTINGS ===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign connectionTypeId = 10 -%}
{%- assign listUrl = '/next-steps/volunteer' -%}

{%- assign oppId = 'Global' | PageParameter:'OpportunityId' | AsInteger | Default:0 -%}
{%- assign opp = null -%}
{%- if oppId > 0 -%}
{%- connectionopportunity id:'{{ oppId }}' securityenabled:'false' -%}
  {%- if connectionopportunity.IsActive and connectionopportunity.ConnectionTypeId == connectionTypeId %}{% assign opp = connectionopportunity %}{% endif -%}
{%- endconnectionopportunity -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if opp %}
{%- assign oppName = opp.PublicName | Default:opp.Name -%}
{%- assign teamName = opp | Attribute:'ConnectedTeam' | Trim -%}
{%- assign oppSummary = opp.Summary | StripHtml | Trim -%}
{%- comment -%} The contact: the first default connector (set per campus on the opportunity) with an active email {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign connectorEmail = '' -%}
{%- assign connectorName = '' -%}
{%- for oppCampus in opp.ConnectionOpportunityCampuses -%}
  {%- assign connector = oppCampus.DefaultConnectorPersonAlias.Person -%}
  {%- if connector and connector.Email != '' and connector.IsEmailActive -%}
    {%- assign connectorEmail = connector.Email -%}
    {%- assign connectorName = connector.NickName | Default:connector.FirstName -%}
    {%- break -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{{ oppName | SetPageTitle }}

<article class="volunteer-detail" data-volunteer-detail="{{ opp.Id }}" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
  <meta itemprop="headline" content="{{ oppName | Escape }}">
  <div class="volunteer-detail__card" data-gd-card>

    <!-- ===== FRONT: the opportunity ===== -->
    <section class="volunteer-detail__face" data-gd-front aria-labelledby="vd-name">
      <header class="volunteer-detail__hero{% if opp.PhotoId %} volunteer-detail__hero--photo{% else %} content-photo--placeholder{% endif %}">
        {%- if opp.PhotoId %}
        <img class="volunteer-detail__hero-img" src="/GetImage.ashx?id={{ opp.PhotoId }}&amp;w=1400&amp;h=467&amp;mode=crop" width="1400" height="467" alt="" decoding="async">
        {%- endif %}
        <div class="volunteer-detail__hero-text">
          {%- if teamName != '' %}
          <p class="volunteer-detail__kicker">{{ teamName }}</p>
          {%- endif %}
          <h1 class="volunteer-detail__name" id="vd-name">{{ oppName }}</h1>
        </div>
        {%- if connectorEmail != '' %}
        <a class="volunteer-detail__contact" href="mailto:{{ connectorEmail }}?subject={{ oppName | EscapeDataString }}"><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-mail"/></svg> Email {{ connectorName }}</a>
        {%- endif %}
      </header>

      {%- if oppSummary != '' %}
      <p class="volunteer-detail__summary">{{ oppSummary }}</p>
      {%- endif %}

      {%- if opp.Description != '' %}
      <div class="volunteer-detail__text" itemprop="articleBody">{{ opp.Description }}</div>
      {%- endif %}

      <footer class="volunteer-detail__actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-gd-flip hidden>Sign up to serve</button>
        <a class="btn btn--outline volunteer-detail__all" href="{{ listUrl }}">All opportunities</a>
      </footer>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== BACK: sign up (theme.js moves the sign-up block in here) ===== -->
    <section class="volunteer-detail__face" data-gd-back aria-labelledby="vd-signup" hidden>
      <header class="volunteer-detail__band content-photo--placeholder">
        <button type="button" class="volunteer-detail__back" data-gd-unflip><svg width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-left"/></svg> Back</button>
        <p class="volunteer-detail__kicker">Sign up</p>
        <h2 class="volunteer-detail__name volunteer-detail__name--slim" id="vd-signup" tabindex="-1">{{ oppName }}</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="volunteer-detail__form" data-gd-slot></div>
    </section>

  </div>
</article>
{%- else %}
<article class="volunteer-detail">
  <div class="volunteer-detail__card">
    <div class="volunteer-detail__text">
      <p>We couldn't find that opportunity. It may be full or no longer open.</p>
    </div>
    <footer class="volunteer-detail__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--outline volunteer-detail__all" href="{{ listUrl }}">All opportunities</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</article>
{%- endif %}
